spans.s:
विज, अस्, m., Ved. one who trembles or is agitated;
a gamester, gambler; a harasser, vexer, (Sāy. on
Ṛg-veda

वि-जातीय, अस्, आ, अम्, of different or mixed origin;
of different birth or caste; of different tribe or species;
of a different kind or sort, dissimilar.

विजन वि-जन, अस्, आ, अम्, free from people,
private, lonely, solitary; (अम्), n. a solitary place,
desert; (ए), ind. privately.

विज्जल, अस्, आ, अम्, m. f. n. = विज्जन above;
(अम्), n. an arrow.
—विज्जल-पुर, N. of a town.

वि-जृम्भित, अस्, आ, अम्, yawned, gaped; ex-
panded, opened, unfolded, displayed, exhibited, acted;
blossomed; arisen, appeared; sported, wantoned;
(अम्), n. pastime, sport; wish, desire; act.
—वि-
जृम्भित-स्नेह, अस्, आ, अम्, displaying affection.

वीज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, sprung or produced from seed;
sprung from or belonging to any family; of a good
family (at the end of a comp.).
